# Line-ending policy.
#
# `apps/api/app/static/tracker.js` is served verbatim as bytes by the API at
# /tf.js and /v.js. It is a build artifact (the esbuild output of
# apps/api/tracker/src/index.ts) but it is committed, because it must be
# identical for every deployment.
#
# With core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout rewrites LF to CRLF, which would
# silently change the exact bytes every customer's browser downloads — the
# payload is not normalised afterwards, and the assertions in
# apps/api/tests/test_tracker.py are content-light, so the change would go
# unnoticed. `-text` disables EOL conversion for this file so the bytes on disk
# always match the bytes on the wire.
apps/api/app/static/tracker.js -text
